  "description": "After breaking off her engagement to her douchebag fiance, the last thing Jae-Eun expects is to start sleeping with her boss, Seo-Kwon. But when an intimate night of drinking leads to a heated tryst at a hotel, the unlikely pair learn that they have unmatched chemistry in the bedroom. This then sparks a passionate coworkers-with-benefits relationship that puts more at risk than their reputation at the office. With Seo-Kwon being a single father and Jae-Eun's recent breakup, they both know bringing feelings into the mix will only complicate things. Still, keeping things purely physical proves easier said than done... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
